1 REM FBCS PRG-0193
2 REM CLAIM A-4.2.2-TR157
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 4.2.2 l.1317-1320 and 10.4.2 l.5621-5622: PRINT USING n takes the IMAGE of its own unit, also written before the IMAGE.
10 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E, F, G
20 IMAGE:M###
30 PRINT USING 20: 1
40 CALL E
50 CALL F
60 CALL G
70 PRINT USING 20: 5
80 END
6 EXTERNAL SUB E
20 IMAGE:E###
30 PRINT USING 20: 2
80 END SUB
7 EXTERNAL SUB F
20 IMAGE:F#.#
30 PRINT USING 20: 3
80 END SUB
8 EXTERNAL SUB G
10 PRINT USING 20: 4
20 IMAGE:G##
80 END SUB
